OL,3,AGovernment condemns 'thuggish'
OL,4,Abehaviour in Portsmouth after second
OL,5,Asmall boats protest of weekend
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Portsmouth protests followed a
OL,8,Fsimilar protest in Dover on Saturday,
OL,9,Fwhich led to hours of disruption for
OL,10,Ftravellers
OL,12,FIt's thought more than 500 migrants
OL,13,Fcrossed the Channel in small boats
OL,14,Fyesterday - figures will be confirmed
OL,15,Flater by the Home Office
